              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Remove pct. Use t=y for test mode (RFC 9989 section 4.7); omit t or use t=n to enforce fully.",
                "markdown": "Remove pct. Use t=y for test mode (RFC 9989 section 4.7); omit t or use t=n to enforce fully."
