          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "github.com: Legacy \"pct=100\" tag — removed in RFC 9989 and ignored by receivers that follow it. pct=100 equals the default, so behaviour is unchanged. Remediation: Remove pct. To keep a policy in test mode use t=y (RFC 9989 section 4.7: failing mail is handled one level below the published policy); omit t or use t=n to enforce fully."
          },
